#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:97
#: 9e14dea9a3f045019e05cd45a1c81cc4
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:99
#: dd7ff9acf7344c2194404eff322c55d8
msgid ""
"The R6 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all"
" ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"R6 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（它们需要真正的 UART"
" 连接）。但以此方式连接的 FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无遥测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:101
#: a6873b64a67e49688b68eebfcc4f9fea
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, the R6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART RX pin "
"for use with bi-directional systems by setting the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 "
"port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""
"要允许 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机使用 CRSF 和内嵌遥测，可通过将 "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` 设置为 「1」，将 R6 引脚配置为真正的 UART RX "
"引脚，以支持双向系统，使其成为 SERIAL6 端口的 RX 输入引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:103
#: be7d02695aef47d3a8686f61c60529e4
msgid ""
"With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to "
"\"23\", and:"
msgstr "使用此选项时，:ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 必须设置为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:105
#: a0cb8d7793b34d5dbb3b60797557fe57
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:107
#: a3d8b616ab1f47449074ccc61a2f9c69
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 R6 引脚，但 SBUS 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"设为「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:109
#: 4a9203cffc784515a97798d3c63e4aac
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 T6，并将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:111
#: 1aee231bd94d4e9aa8c5f4a938582ec2
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除需要 R6 外还需要 T6 连接，并自动提供遥测。设置 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` "
"为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:113
#: 4f150e04641940e48059aab86189873e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 T6，并自动提供遥测。设置 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:115
#: d81f4eadf6ce4015b5e2551dfaf0b38a
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任意 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，兼容除 PPM 以外的所有协议。详情请参见 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:118
#: 6a36ec4c3ae44a5c8c8ffe2ce09127a7
