msgstr "FrSky 遥测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:120
#: 5c692e216a084275b6592805306aaf98
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using the T6 pin (UART6 transmit). You need to "
"set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT"
msgstr "FrSky 遥测通过 T6 引脚（UART6 发送）支持。需要设置以下参数以启用对 FrSky S.PORT 的支持"

