msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:128
#: 7db93dca32064d7b83f51c89d9a0f138
msgid ""
"The KakuteF7 AIO supports OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1 (MAX7456 "
"driver)."
msgstr "KakuteF7 AIO 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:131
#: 582323ec795843788c7943367c60e428
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:133
#: baf7980fe81b40929bfe826f848c6286
msgid ""
"The KakuteF7 supports up to 6 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output M1 to "
"M6 on the above diagram are for the 6 outputs. All 6 outputs support DShot "
"as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"KakuteF7 最多支持 6 路 PWM 输出。上图中电机输出 M1 到 M6 的焊盘对应 6 路输出。所有 6 路输出均支持 DShot 及所有 "
"PWM 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:135
#: 546c9361978f45c9a937dfd2f6965578
msgid "The PWM is in 3 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 3 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:137
#: 46e92cb3caf84dec9a0ac00022961741
msgid "PWM 1, 2 and 3 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 和 3 为第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:138
#: 2a1e592817314fa9b34953338ff78ed0
msgid "PWM 4 and 5 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 4 和 5 为第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:139
#: 9ce45e997b6f4efd8034d80f5ac523c5
msgid "PWM 6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 6 为第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:141
#: bc855ccbb1ca46ed98e1db2e2e9225bc
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate, whether PWM"
" or Dshot. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道无论使用 PWM 还是 DShot 都必须使用相同的输出频率。若组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:146
