#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:163
#: e6213cd2c2c14e8c916709164a9e3a4c
msgid ""
"The Kakute F7 and Kakute F7 AIO do not have a built-in compass, however you "
"can attach an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
